# API — staff auth

- `staff/auth` module + cookie `cabin.pms.sid` (httpOnly session in Postgres).
- Roles: `SUPER_ADMIN` > `ADMIN` > `FRONT_DESK`. `@StaffRoles(X)` = **X or higher** (minimum role, not exact allowlist).
- Use `StaffSessionAuthGuard` + `@StaffRoles(...)` / `StaffRolesGuard` on all `/staff/*` HTTP (not only auth).
